### Test Pharmacy Order Creation with Zero Stock
### This test verifies that orders can be created even when medicine stock is 0
### This test validates the fix for the issue: "Insufficient stock for medicine: Amoxicillin 500 mg"

### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### Authorization: Replace with valid JWT tokens

### Step 1: Create a medicine with 0 stock
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Amoxicillin 500 mg",
  "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
  "category": "64b8f1a8b5a1234567890abc",
  "price": 15.99,
  "stock": 0,
  "manufacturer": "Test Pharma Corp",
  "description": "Antibiotic for bacterial infections",
  "dosage": "500mg",
  "sideEffects": ["Nausea", "Diarrhea", "Allergic reactions"],
  "interactions": ["Oral contraceptives", "Probenecid"],
  "ingredients": ["Amoxicillin", "Inactive ingredients"],
  "storage": "Store at room temperature",
  "expiryDate": "2026-06-30T00:00:00Z"
}

### Step 2: Create a prescription for the zero-stock medicine
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/prescriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "appointmentId": "64b8f1a8b5a1234567890def",
  "medicines": [
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 2,
      "dosage": "500mg",
      "frequency": "Three times daily",
      "duration": "7 days"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": "Take with food",
  "notes": "Test prescription for zero stock medicine"
}

### Step 3: Create an order with zero stock medicine (SHOULD NOW SUCCEED)
### This is the critical test - before the fix, this would fail with "Insufficient stock for medicine: Amoxicillin 500 mg"
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "prescriptionId": "PRESCRIPTION_ID_FROM_STEP2_RESPONSE",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "street": "123 Zero Stock Street",
    "city": "Test City",
    "state": "Test State",
    "zipCode": "12345",
    "country": "Test Country"
  },
  "deliveryMethod": "standard"
}

### Expected Success Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "message": "Order placed successfully",
###   "timestamp": "2025-12-06T04:45:00.000Z",
###   "data": {
###     "orderId": "ORD_1733469900000_123",
###     "prescriptionId": "PRESCRIPTION_ID",
###     "totalAmount": 31.98,
###     "status": "pending",
###     "estimatedDelivery": "2025-12-13T04:45:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### Step 4: Verify the order was created successfully
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders/ORDER_ID_FROM_STEP3_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "orderId": "ORD_1733469900000_123",
###     "prescriptionId": "PRESCRIPTION_ID",
###     "items": [
###       {
###         "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID",
###         "quantity": 2,
###         "price": 15.99
###       }
###     ],
###     "totalAmount": 31.98,
###     "status": "pending",
###     "estimatedDelivery": "2025-12-13T04:45:00.000Z"
###   }
### }

### Step 5: Verify medicine stock is still 0 (no change during order creation)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/medicines/MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "data": {
###     "id": "MEDICINE_ID",
###     "name": "Amoxicillin 500 mg",
###     "stock": 0,
###     "price": 15.99,
###     ...
###   }
### }

