### Step 8: Create order with mixed stock medicines (SHOULD SUCCEED)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/pharmacy/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_PATIENT_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "prescriptionId": "PRESCRIPTION_ID_FROM_STEP7_RESPONSE",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP1_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "medicineId": "MEDICINE_ID_FROM_STEP6_RESPONSE",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ],
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "street": "456 Mixed Stock Avenue",
    "city": "Test City",
    "state": "Test State",
    "zipCode": "12345",
    "country": "Test Country"
